    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Inner Circle Task Force",
    "summary": "In [your Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), 1 **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** can be picked as your **vowed objective** until the start of your next Command phase. Attacks by your **DEATHWING INFANTRY** units against enemy units in range of the **vowed objective** get +1 to [Wound](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls).\n\nYour army can contain **DARK ANGELS** units, and no **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units of any other Chapter.",
